<h2 id="pathway"><span class="num">8</span><span class="l-en">The predictive pathway</span><span class="l-zh">预测路径</span></h2>
<div class="callout lead"><span class="co-h"><span class="l-en">The through-line</span><span class="l-zh">主线</span></span> <span class="l-en">The pathway resolves in three phases: an <strong>engineered blow-off</strong> into the November election, a <strong>support withdrawal</strong> as the political floor drops, and a <strong>2027 resolution</strong> that runs through three branches. In every branch the state's real objective survives.</span><span class="l-zh">这条路径分三个阶段展开：进入 11 月选举的<strong>工程化最后冲刺</strong>、政治底板下降带来的<strong>支持撤退</strong>，以及分成三条分支的 <strong>2027 年解决</strong>。无论哪条分支，国家真正的目标都能存活。</span></div>

<h3><span class="l-en">Phase 1 — now through November 3, 2026 (the engineered blow-off)</span><span class="l-zh">第一阶段 — 从现在到 2026 年 11 月 3 日（工程化的最后冲刺）</span></h3>

<p><span class="l-en">Every administration incentive converges on maximum support: today's Commerce report as a tariff-relief lever, wealth-fund populism, and the OpenAI IPO (~September, up to $1T) as both a liquidity event and constituency creation. Post-Iran-ceasefire gas declines give Bessent his disinflation prints; Warsh softens rhetoric with the "AI is deflationary" ramp pre-built. See <a href="report_warsh_fomc.html">The Warsh Shock</a> and <a href="report_bessent_jun24.html">The Bessent Bridge</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">所有政府激励都指向最大支持：今天的商务部报告可作为关税缓释杠杆；财富基金民粹主义；OpenAI IPO（约 9 月，最高约 1 万亿美元）既是流动性事件，也是利益共同体创造。伊朗停火后油价下行，给 Bessent 带来通胀回落数据；Warsh 通过"AI 是通缩力量"的预设退路软化言辞。参见 <a href="report_warsh_fomc.html">The Warsh Shock</a> 与 <a href="report_bessent_jun24.html">The Bessent Bridge</a>。</span></p>

<ul>
<li><span class="l-en"><strong>Base case (~60%, estimate):</strong> grind higher into the election, with June-style leverage flushes along the way.</span><span class="l-zh"><strong>基准情形（约 60%，估计）：</strong>一路震荡上行进入选举，途中伴随类似 6 月的杠杆清洗。</span></li>
<li><span class="l-en"><strong>Adverse tail (~15–20%):</strong> CPI refuses to roll, 9 dots become a September hike, and a pre-election air pocket opens.</span><span class="l-zh"><strong>负面尾部（约 15–20%）：</strong>CPI 拒绝回落，9 个点阵图支持者变成 9 月加息，选前出现真空下跌。</span></li>
</ul>

<p><span class="l-en">The <strong>October 27–28 FOMC</strong> sits six days before the election.</span><span class="l-zh"><strong>10 月 27–28 日 FOMC</strong> 距离选举只有六天。</span></p>

<h3><span class="l-en">Phase 2 — November 2026 through mid-2027 (the support withdrawal)</span><span class="l-zh">第二阶段 — 2026 年 11 月至 2027 年中（支持撤退）</span></h3>

<p><span class="l-en">The political floor drops regardless of outcome: post-election, the administration no longer needs to hold the tape. If the GOP loses the House — a live risk — expect investigations, dead preemption, and a hostile appropriations posture layered onto the depreciation reckoning and the first honest hyperscaler capex-language downshift.</span><span class="l-zh">无论结果如何，选后政治底板都会下降：政府不再需要托住盘面。如果共和党失去众议院——这是现实风险——那么预期会出现调查、联邦预先排除立法失效、敌对拨款姿态，并叠加折旧清算以及超大云厂商首次真实地下调资本开支措辞。</span></p>

<p><span class="l-en">Why the House loss is live risk:</span><span class="l-zh">为何失去众议院是现实风险：</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span class="l-en">75 projects worth $130B blocked in Q1 2026;</span><span class="l-zh">2026 年一季度已有价值 1300 亿美元的 75 个项目被阻止；</span></li>
<li><span class="l-en">four PA toss-ups fought on electricity prices;</span><span class="l-zh">宾州四个摇摆席位围绕电价竞争；</span></li>
<li><span class="l-en">~60% of Trump voters worried about AI and ~80% wanting more regulation;</span><span class="l-zh">约 60% 特朗普选民担心 AI、约 80% 希望加强监管；</span></li>
<li><span class="l-en">Republicans (Mace, Fishback) running against data centers.</span><span class="l-zh">共和党人（Mace、Fishback）也在反数据中心议题上竞选。</span></li>
</ul>

<div class="callout warn"><span class="co-h"><span class="l-en">The regime break to watch</span><span class="l-zh">需要盯住的制度断点</span></span> <span class="l-en">The first <strong>"optimization" / "digestion"</strong> phrasing in hyperscaler guidance is the tell — that is the regime break.</span><span class="l-zh">超大云厂商指引中第一次出现<strong>"优化" / "消化"</strong>措辞就是信号——这就是制度断点。</span></div>

<h3><span class="l-en">Phase 3 — 2027 (resolution)</span><span class="l-zh">第三阶段 — 2027 年（解决）</span></h3>

<p><span class="l-en">Three branches. Probabilities are <em>estimates</em>.</span><span class="l-zh">三条分支。概率为<em>估计</em>。</span></p>

