<tr>
<td><span class="l-en"><strong>(a) Validation</strong></span><span class="l-zh"><strong>(a) 验证成功</strong></span></td>
<td class="num"><span class="l-en">~25%</span><span class="l-zh">约 25%</span></td>
<td><span class="l-en">AI revenue closes the gap (Google Cloud's $460B backlog is the bulls' best datapoint), the Greenspan analogy holds, the cycle extends; memory stays supply-constrained "beyond 2027" and SCA floors never get tested.</span><span class="l-zh">AI 收入补上缺口（Google Cloud 的 4600 亿美元 backlog 是多头最强数据点），格林斯潘类比成立，周期延长；内存供给紧张"持续到 2027 年以后"，SCA 底价从未被测试。</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
