<td class="num"><span class="l-en">~40–45%</span><span class="l-zh">约 40–45%</span></td>
<td><span class="l-en">A break in the Oracle / neocloud / OpenAI-commitment chain (OpenAI's $1.4T of commitments against ~$13B revenue is the obvious candidate, or the $300B ABS take-out wall) → NBFI stress → Treasury-led rescue of strategic nodes via the sovereign fund at marked-down prices, "no bailout" maintained for equity holders while the state consolidates assets. Equities <span class="r-neg">−30–50%</span> from peak; memory <span class="r-neg">−60%+</span> regardless of floors; Warsh cutting hard into the demand destruction only <em>after</em> the drawdown.</span><span class="l-zh">Oracle / neocloud / OpenAI 承诺链条发生断裂（OpenAI 以约 130 亿美元收入支撑 1.4 万亿美元承诺，是最明显候选；或 3000 亿美元 ABS 接盘墙）→ 非银金融机构压力 → 财政部通过主权基金以折价价格主导救援战略节点；对股东仍维持"没有 bailout"的说法，同时国家整合资产。股市较峰值下跌 <span class="r-neg">−30–50%</span>；内存不管底价如何都会走 <span class="r-neg">−60% 以上</span>标准周期；Warsh 只有在需求毁灭已经发生<em>之后</em>才会大幅降息。</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><span class="l-en"><strong>(c) Managed digestion</strong></span><span class="l-zh"><strong>(c) 可控消化</strong></span></td>
<td class="num"><span class="l-en">~30%</span><span class="l-zh">约 30%</span></td>
<td><span class="l-en">Capex plateaus rather than breaks; multiple compression grinds without a credit event (Capital Economics path: <span class="num">8,250</span> → <span class="num">6,500</span>).</span><span class="l-zh">资本开支平台化而不是断裂，估值倍数压缩缓慢进行，没有信用事件（Capital Economics 路径：<span class="num">8,250</span> → <span class="num">6,500</span>）。</span></td>
</tr>
</table>

<div class="callout key"><span class="co-h"><span class="l-en">The plan survives every branch</span><span class="l-zh">计划在每条分支中都存活</span></span> <span class="l-en">In every branch, the administration's actual objective — installed U.S. compute, fabs, and gigawatts, plus state equity and toll positions — survives. <strong>The plan does not require the bubble to end well. It requires the bubble to end late and to end onshore.</strong></span><span class="l-zh">无论哪条分支，政府真正的目标——安装在美国境内的算力、晶圆厂与千兆瓦，以及国家股权和收费头寸——都能存活下来。<strong>这个计划并不要求泡沫善终。它只要求泡沫晚点结束，并且在美国本土结束。</strong></span></div>

